Create a C++ program that computes the weighted average of the given array elements, where each element is multiplied by its corresponding weight. The weights are provided in a separate array. The program should also output the index of the maximum element in the array. Additionally, the program should handle the case where the array elements and weights are of different lengths and provide appropriate error handling. 

arr = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}
weights = {0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.2, 0.2}

